#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""install_smart2.py - run from the project folder (~/W):  python3 install_smart2.py
ONE installer for the whole smart-search feature, as a switch in Simple AND Advanced mode:
   Simple:   "Smart search (finds papers by meaning)" checkbox
   Advanced: "Smart search" switch in Filters
It also contains the private search service (search_api.py), OpenAlex key support, the daily limit and the
status page /api/smart-status, so you do NOT need install_privateapi, install_smart or install_smartcheck
(it skips whatever is already there). The switch is OFF by default. Safe to run twice.
Needs install_search2 to 9 first (it checks and tells you which one is missing)."""
